  "details": "To reproduce;  Enter, or make, a world with an ObjectPool of PickUp objects in it and have two players in the world (eg; push button, a ball spawns).  Have player one spawn the entire compliment of objects in the Pool without player two attempting to do so at all.  If Player two's first interaction with the pool is while it's empty, their client will immediately crash.\nIf Player two has previously successfully spawned an object from the Pool and either attempt to spawn from an empty Object Pool, a crash will not occur.",
